  "schematic_notes": [
    "SOURCE: TI INA228 SLYS021A/SBOU241E, TPS709 SBVS186H, TCA9517 SCPS242D; Vishay30131.",
    "FUNCTION: branch current and load-side VBUS; local telemetry supply is upstream of shunt.",
    "MODIFICATION: 2mOhm Kelvin shunt,10Ohm/100nF differential filter; separate 3.3 V host/local domains.",
    "RATIONALE: low shunt loss,0x40 address,100kHz initial bus; no direct host/local supply or ALERT tie.",
    "KELVIN: I+/S+ on source end; I-/S- on load end. S pads carry no load. Project pin numbers need footprint review.",
    "External LOAD supply can power local telemetry through shunt; negative reading then includes local demand.",
    "OPEN: output disconnect, shunt footprint, full power-state leakage test and bus VOL/rise-time measurements."
  ],
